# --- debug/reports/ : generated capture output (keep dir + .gitkeep) ---
reports/*.log
reports/workbench-*.json
reports/workbench_*.txt
!reports/.gitkeep

# --- debug/ root : ad-hoc scratch/smoke notes (any name) ---
# Ignore everything here except harness scripts, run helpers, and docs.
# Scratch = extensionless files or .txt; harnesses = .mjs / .sh / .bat / .md
/*
!README.md
!capture-*.mjs
!run-*.sh
!run-*.bat
!*.md
!reports/
!.gitignore
/*.txt
